---
---

<header class="hero">
  <div class="intro">
    <h1>Saul Herman</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">IT Manager & Platform Engineer</p>
    <p class="description">
      IT Manager at Neara, building identity lifecycle automation and AI-agent-operated IT platforms.
      Ex-Atlassian, where I managed 17,000+ macOS devices at scale.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-links">
    <a href="mailto:saulmherman@icloud.com" class="btn primary">Get in touch</a>
    <a href="/saul_herman_resume.pdf" class="btn primary" download>Resume PDF</a>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    font-size: var(--title-size);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .description {
    max-width: 600px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--sub);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hero-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .btn {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: rgba(232, 213, 163, 0.05);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(232, 213, 163, 0.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
